{'symbol': 'LMT', 'date': '2021-08-02 13:29:00', 'title': "NASA'S LUCY SPACECRAFT BEGINS LAUNCH PREPARATIONS", 'text': 'DENVER, AUG. 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NASA\'S LUCY SPACECRAFT HAS OFFICIALLY ARRIVED AT KENNEDY SPACE CENTER, FLORIDA, TO BEGIN PREPARATIONS AHEAD OF ITS LAUNCH THIS FALL.\xa0 "THIS SPACECRAFT IS SO MUCH MORE THAN A PIECE OF HARDWARE, IT\'S A WORK OF ART, AND I\'M INCREDIBLY PROUD OF HOW THE TEAM CAME TOGETHER TO BUILD THIS THROUGH A GLOBAL PANDEMIC," SAID RICH LIPE, LOCKHEED MARTIN LUCY PROGRAM MANAGER.'}